        "readiness": {
            "timeoutSeconds": 5
        }
    },
    "expected_effect": "Allow the app to start without being killed by liveness probes and respond to readiness probes before timing out.",
    "rationale": "The current liveness probe timeout (2s) and readiness probe timeout (2s) are likely too short for the app's startup time, causing restarts and probe failures. Increasing these timeouts to 5s provides more time for the app to start and respond to probes without being killed.",
